    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR1f0001-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">relatives are made comfortable by it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">in sacrifices, ghosts enjoy it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">Because of this, the world is peaceful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">disasters do not arise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">calamities do not occur.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">Therefore, this is how enlightened rulers govern the world through filial piety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">The *Shī* (Classic of Poetry) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">"With awakened virtue and conduct,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_008-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">the four realms submit to him."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">*Shèng Zhì Zhāng* (Chapter on Sage Governance)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">Zēng Zǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">"May I venture to ask, is there any virtue of a sage</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">that exceeds filial piety?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">The Master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">"Of the nature of Heaven and Earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">humanity is the most valued.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">Of human conduct,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">nothing is greater than filial piety;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">of filial piety, nothing is greater than revering one's father;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">of revering one's father, nothing is greater than matching him with Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">Thus, Zhōu Gōng was such a person.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">In the past, Zhōu Gōng performed suburban sacrifices to Hòujì</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">to match him with Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">and ancestral sacrifices to Wén Wáng in the Bright Hall</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">to match him with God.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">Because of this, within the four seas,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">each came to sacrifice according to their office.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">What virtue of a sage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">then, could exceed filial piety?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">Therefore, when they are raised on the knees of their parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">the daily reverence of nurturing one's parents is emphasized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">The sage thus uses reverence to teach respect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1f0001_tls_009-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-20T21:20:27.063+09:00">and uses affection to teach love.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
